// expect: refuse E_EffectMismatch
// MINTING A CLOSURE ALLOCATES its record in the frame that mints it — a
// lambda passed as an argument is minted there. Measured 2026-09-28 on boot
// 0976f1d7: `!Alloc` accepted it while the heap grew 16 bytes per call
// (Hβ.effects.install-allocates-unrowed, the allocation census).
fn apply(g, v) = g(v)

fn shift(x) with !Alloc = apply((y) => y + x, 1)

fn main() = shift(4)
